  "caption": "The mistake: Westminster Abbey on a Sunday. Sky Garden or the London Eye? 👇\n\nThree days that beat the crowds: the Abbey any day but Sunday (it's worship only), the free Sky Garden booked up to three weeks ahead, and the National Gallery, free and open until 9 on Fridays.\n\nUrban Tales plans your trip in a minute and tells you the story of every stop as you walk.\n.\n.\n.\n#london #londonitinerary #londontravel #traveltips #urbantales",
  "dm": "London · 3 days\nDay 1: Buckingham Palace → Westminster Abbey → Big Ben → London Eye\nDay 2: St Paul's Cathedral → Sky Garden → Tower of London → Tower Bridge at sunset\nDay 3: Trafalgar Square → National Gallery → Hyde Park → V&A Museum\nTip: the Abbey is worship-only on Sundays, and the free Sky Garden slots open three weeks ahead."
